POST /api/coding-tasks/{id}/apply: eligibility (completed + verify_tests passed +
evidence digest) -> preflight (STALE_BASE / DIRTY_TARGET / PROTECTED_PATH /
APPLY_CHECK_FAILED on exact diff bytes) -> single-use approval (kind=coding_apply,
preview bound to task id + base + evidence digest, approvals.consume) -> locked
re-check, git apply to working tree only, after-state compare, rollback on failure.
`bossman code apply <id> [--approval-id N]` (0 / 4 / 5 / 11). NO_APPROVE guard
moved into the terminal client. IsolatedWorktree clones with the source's
effective core.autocrlf/core.eol.

